1. Professional Data Engineer
What they build
Lakehouses
Notebooks
Spark Jobs
Data Pipelines
Dataflows
Eventstreams
Why they need Git

They already use:

Azure DevOps
GitHub
CI/CD pipelines

for code and infrastructure.

Their expectation is:

Code
Infrastructure
Data Pipelines
Fabric Assets
↓
Same Git Workflow

Top needs
Branching
Pull Requests
Automation
Service Principals
CI/CD
Common quote themes

"Fabric needs to fit into our existing DevOps process."

"Git readiness should be Day-1."

2. Analytics Engineer / BI Developer
What they build
Semantic Models
Power BI Reports
Metrics
Paginated Reports
Why they need Git

Historically they struggled with:

Report overwrites
Lost changes
No rollback
Shared workspace conflicts
Top needs
Version history
Rollback
Change tracking
Safe collaboration
Success metric

Instead of:

